            name: "create-adapter-version",
            description: Some("Creates a new version of an adapter. Operates on a provided AdapterId and a specified dataset provided via the DatasetConfig argument. Requires that you specify an Amazon S3 bucket with the OutputConfig argument. You can provide an optional KMSKeyId, an optional ClientRequestToken, and optional tags"),
